5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be efficient. I want to ensure the financial side is transparent this year.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is key. However, the quality of the stay is what actually determines the camp's success.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want everyone to have a good time. I hope the planning isn't too hard for anyone.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We need a realistic budget. I'll look into the costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Budget isn't everything. If we just go to the same place, we'll just stay in our own little groups again.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, if you want a change, we need data on other locations.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. I'm more interested in the actual environment and how it affects our performance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I wonder who did the work last year... I don't want anyone to be too tired.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, that's a valid point. We should check the workload.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I don't care about the workload as much as the atmosphere. We need to break these walls between year-groups.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll focus on the financial records and the booking terms to avoid any hidden costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll investigate the actual conditions of the facilities and the previous attendance patterns.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I think I'll look into the cooking duties and the public booking process.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll check the transport receipts and the prefecture rate sheets.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm going to see what the seniors say about the mixing and check the attendance sheets.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
