31,2,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Takumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The transport costs vary wildly depending on the distance. We must consider this in the flat fee.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,I've found that whole-building lets are risky financially if people drop out. We should be careful.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that cooking for everyone is a lot of work. Maybe we should find a place with a canteen?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, you're right. Transport is the biggest variable. We can't just guess the cost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"If we choose a place where we're split up into different rooms or buildings, we're just going to fail again.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minato, a canteen is safer, but we need to check if the cost is inclusive or extra.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your obsession with ""mixing"" shouldn't override the need for a stable environment.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I also saw that public bookings have a very long application process. It seems really stressful.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, if the process is stressful, we should start now. But the budget must be precise.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,Stability is boring if it means we don't actually bond. We need a place that forces us together.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"I'm concerned about the non-refundable deposits. If one person cancels, the others pay. That's unfair.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,Which is why a public facility might be better. It's more standardized and less volatile.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,I just don't want the organizers to spend all their free time on paperwork and cooking.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I've seen the transport receipts. If we go too far, the cost spikes. We should stay within a reasonable distance.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"I've seen the attendance sheets. People are quitting the club because they don't feel connected. We can't afford another ""safe"" camp.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"We need a balance. A place that is affordable, manageable, and encourages interaction without financial risk.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"Logic suggests a public facility with a whole-building let if the price is right, but the risk is high.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,Maybe a place that handles the food and has a simple booking process?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'll support any option that has a fixed, predictable cost. No more ""estimated"" fees.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I'll support any option that puts us all in one space. No separate dorms for different years.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
